{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Touhou fan fiction RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic dungeon strategy RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each dungeon, defeat the boss, and advance to the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To proceed to the next dungeon, you must listen to the townspeople's stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944500/extras/2b6555e114cdbf5383a0b77b6abdf68c.avif?t=1758351863\" width=1276 height=846 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is set in a parallel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yumemi from another world appears in Reimu's world and attempts to take away the concept of magic...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stop her, the girls rise up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countermeasures, tactics, and luck. When all of these come together,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >victory is possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Abundant hidden items (small medal system).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Hidden Forest system: Enter a forest somewhere within the field.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944500?t=1758351863","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944500/9a24fa145cef43d3befb799e6352d6e0405001b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758351863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944500/6a91c52b43868cdf20bf3d4da1941338bc922010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758351863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944500/6a91c52b43868cdf20bf3d4da1941338bc922010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758351863","categories":[{"description":"Single-play